        "text": "Here Pr represents a discretization of the dynamic pressure; T the effect of (turbulent) viscosity and S includes all other source terms. The discretization of the (turbulent) viscous terms is given by central differences:"
      }
    ],
    "following_nonempty_paragraphs": [
